      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I had a stroke a couple years back and still have muscle weakness in my face, so I don't talk, I use TTS but because I can only use 1 hand to type I find it difficult to insert my self in conversations, so i just stay silent most of the time. it would be nice if the emoji menu was rearrangeable and \"hello\" \"yes\" \"no\" and other simple answers where added",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
